    "profile_text": {
        "body": "Pony AI Inc. describes itself as a global autonomous driving technology company founded in 2016 in Silicon Valley. Its website says the company is developing autonomous driving technology and operates three business units: Robotaxi, Robotruck, and Personally Owned Vehicles (POV). The company refers to its core technology as a \"virtual driver.\"\n\nThe company states it has accumulated millions of kilometers in autonomous road testing, and that its autonomous vehicles had traveled over 32 million kilometers (over 13 million miles) on urban roads and highways as of April 2024. It also says it has secured licenses and credentials to test and operate autonomous driving vehicles in multiple locations worldwide.\n\nPony AI Inc. is a public company trading under the ticker PONY, with CIK 0001969302 and headquarters in Guangzhou. No lawsuits are listed for the company.",
